@startuml Delete_Milestone
title Activity Diagram - Delete Milestone

|Instructor|
start
:Select a milestone;
:Click "Delete Milestone";
:Confirm deletion;

|Web Application|
:Send request to delete\nmilestone;

|Backend API|
:Call ProjectMilestoneService.\nDeleteAsync(milestoneId);
:Get milestone by ID;
if (Milestone not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  stop
endif

:Delete milestone entity;
:Save changes to database;
:Return success message;
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Refresh milestones list;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View updated milestones list;
stop
@enduml

